# 基准路线：大教堂（第 1 幕，关卡 33）里来回走（cath）——暗处、反光地面：光线追踪最贵的地方。固定存档、固定地图种子，mark 切段。
# Benchmark route: back and forth inside the Cathedral (Act 1, level 33; `cath`): dark, with reflective floors, the dearest place for ray tracing. Fixed save and map seed; mark cuts the segment.
# Same walk as the README clip (readme_art rec.sh "cath 33"), repeated; stick walking on open ground, the automap closed.
name cathedral
requires cli
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
env DM_TEST_GOTO_LEVEL=150:33
timeout 240

enter_game
sleep 6
msg PanelManager:ClosePanel:AutoMap
sleep 1
mark cath
stick -0.6 -0.2 40
stick 0.6 0.2 80
stick -0.6 -0.2 80
stick 0.6 0.2 80
stick -0.6 -0.2 80
stick 0.6 0.2 80
stick -0.6 -0.2 80
stick 0.6 0.2 80
stick -0.6 -0.2 80
stick 0.6 0.2 80
stick -0.6 -0.2 40
mark end
sleep 1
quit
check no_red
